hid, DEFAULT\n    - active image con01_03.png: absol, top 2.362205vw, left 57.311321%, width 66.981132%, natural 284x230, hidden until active\n    - top markers: 3 lines from PSD x1548/x1558/x1568, top 0.052493vw\n    - textStack: absol, top 9.343832vw, left 11.792453%, width 44.811321%, black text, br body preserved\n\nDo not:\n- Do not code before user approves this ASCII.\n- Do not flatten card children into section siblings.\n- Do not make con01_bg_2 part of heightChain.\n- Do not use section height/aspect-ratio, object-fit, max-width, or automatic text wrapping.\n- Do not hide multiline body <br> on mobile."
